          "jcr:created": "Wed Jan 24 2024 19:35:28 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Join Stryker Sports Medicine at the AOSSM Annual Meeting in Seattle. Explore our latest advancements in arthroscopy, soft tissue repair and patient positioning. Whether you're focused on knee, hip or shoulder procedures, our integrated solutions are designed to support your surgical goals.&nbsp;</span></p>\n",
