        },
        "text_copy_copy_279291256": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "bottomPadding": "3",
          "jcr:createdBy": "carissa.frausto@stryker.com",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "brittany.brady@stryker.com",
          "hideComponent": "false",
          "jcr:created": "Tue Jun 04 2024 16:22:57 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">High-performance shoulders: navigating complex instability in the elite athlete</span></span></span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Thu May 28 2026 18:45:58 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        },
        "text_copy_copy": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "carissa.frausto@stryker.com",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "brittany.brady@stryker.com",
          "jcr:created": "Tue Jun 04 2024 16:22:57 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Thursday, July 9 | 12:15–1:45 p.m.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Explore the multifactorial nature of shoulder instability in elite athletes. Through case-based discussion, gain practical insights to treat patients with high demand instability profiles, and learn how Instability on Blueprint enhances patient-specific decision making with accurate, reproducible measurements<sup>1,2</sup> and interactive visuals.</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Faculty: </span>Dr. James Gregory*, Dr. Andrew Sheean*, Dr. Dean Wang*, Dr. Vasilios Moutzouros*, Dr. Gregory Cvetanovich*</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Location:</span> Seattle Convention Center, Arch Building, Level 6, Room 619</span></li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Jun 11 2026 21:56:37 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
      "col2": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
        "standaloneimage": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "kristian.bocage@stryker.com",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "brittany.brady@stryker.com",
          "preset": "max_width_1440",
          "jcr:created": "Mon Jun 02 2025 15:43:39 GMT+0000",
          "alt": "Hip anatomy illustration",
          "srcFileRef": "/content/dam/stryker/sports-medicine/campaigns/aossm/aossm-hip-tile-1200x680.png",
          "borderColor": "rgb(0,0,0)",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri May 29 2026 15:15:06 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/standaloneimage",
          "enableBorder": "true"
        },
        "text_copy_copy": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "bottomPadding": "3",
          "jcr:createdBy": "carissa.frausto@stryker.com",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "brittany.brady@stryker.com",
          "hideComponent": "false",
          "jcr:created": "Tue Jun 04 2024 16:22:57 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Clinical advancements and considerations in hip capsular management</span></span></span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Thu May 28 2026 18:22:57 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        },
        "text_copy_copy_copy": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "carissa.frausto@stryker.com",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "brittany.brady@stryker.com",
          "jcr:created": "Tue Jun 04 2024 16:22:57 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Friday, July 10 | 12:30–1:00 p.m.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Join a panel of expert hip arthroscopy surgeons as they share how they approach capsular management for each patient. Explore key factors—such as instability, bony morphology, age and gender—that influence capsulotomy decisions. Gain technique insights on capsular reconstruction and learn how a new knotless closure implant is eliminating extracapsular knot stacks and providing a new option for closure techniques.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Faculty:&nbsp;</span>Dr. Adam Yanke*, Dr. Alan Zhang*, Dr. Justin Ernat*, Dr. Steven DeFroda*</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Location: </span>Seattle Convention Center, Arch Building, Level 4 Exhibit Hall, Training Center BLUE&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Jun 11 2026 21:56:54 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
      "col3": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
        "standaloneimage_copy": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "kristian.bocage@stryker.com",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "brittany.brady@stryker.com",
          "preset": "max_width_1440",
          "jcr:created": "Mon Jun 02 2025 15:43:39 GMT+0000",
          "alt": "Knee anatomy illustration",
          "srcFileRef": "/content/dam/stryker/sports-medicine/campaigns/aossm/aossm-knee-tile-1200x680.png",
          "borderColor": "rgb(0,0,0)",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri May 29 2026 15:15:13 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/standaloneimage",
          "enableBorder": "true"
        },
        "text_copy_copy": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "bottomPadding": "3",
          "jcr:createdBy": "carissa.frausto@stryker.com",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "brittany.brady@stryker.com",
          "hideComponent": "false",
          "jcr:created": "Tue Jun 04 2024 16:22:57 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">How would you reconstruct it? ACL decision-making in practice</span></span></span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Thu May 28 2026 18:21:34 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "backgroundColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0)",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        },
        "text_copy_copy_copy": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "carissa.frausto@stryker.com",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "brittany.brady@stryker.com",
          "jcr:created": "Tue Jun 04 2024 16:22:57 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Friday, July 10 | 1:15–1:45 p.m.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Explore how patient factors influence ACL reconstruction decisions. Through interactive case discussions—from high-demand athletes to lower-demand patients—faculty will review the role of graft choices like quadriceps versus bone tendon bone, surgical technique preferences and emerging technologies in harvesting and fixation.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Faculty: </span>Dr. Adam Yanke*, Dr. Alan Zhang*, Dr. Justin Ernat*, Dr. Steven DeFroda*</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Location:&nbsp;</span>Seattle Convention Center, Arch Building, Level 4 Exhibit Hall, Training Center BLUE&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Jun 03 2026 19:42:32 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      }
    },
